    <!-- Privacy notice (pending legal review before production, see TODO_LEGAL in PrivacyConsentScreen.kt) -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="privacy_responsible_pending">Gutigu, the team behind Círculo de Confianza. We\'ll publish the full legal registration (legal name, tax ID, and address) here before launch.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section1_title">Who is responsible for your data?</string>
    <string name="privacy_section2_title">What data do we store?</string>
    <string name="privacy_section2_body">Your name and phone number, the names and phone numbers of the people you add to your circle, and whether you confirmed you\'re okay each day. Your location and medication information are sensitive data: you\'re not required to authorize them, but without them we can\'t offer you safe-zone alerts or medication reminders.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section3_title">What do we use it for?</string>
    <string name="privacy_section3_body">Only to make the app work: alerting your circle if you need help or if you didn\'t confirm your wellbeing. We never use it for advertising or sell it to anyone.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section4_title">Who do we share it with?</string>
    <string name="privacy_section4_body">Only with the people you add to your trust circle. No one else has access. We use Firebase (Google) to store your information securely, which means it may be processed on servers outside Colombia, under Google\'s protection standards.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section5_title">How long do we keep your data?</string>
    <string name="privacy_section5_body">While your circle is active. If you leave the circle or ask us to delete your account, we delete your data within a maximum of 30 days, unless the law requires us to keep it longer.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section6_title">Your rights</string>
    <string name="privacy_section6_body">You can know, update, correct, or request the deletion of your data, and you can withdraw this consent at any time — doing so means we\'ll no longer be able to provide you the alert service. We respond to inquiries within a maximum of 10 business days and to complaints within a maximum of 15 business days. If you\'re not satisfied, you can file a complaint with Colombia\'s Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC).</string>
    <string name="privacy_section7_title">Contact</string>
    <string name="privacy_section7_body">To exercise these rights, write to us at contacto@gutigu.com.</string>
    <string name="privacy_accept_button">Accept and continue</string>
    <string name="privacy_decline_button">I don\'t accept</string>
    <string name="privacy_decline_dialog_title">Are you sure you don\'t accept?</string>
    <string name="privacy_decline_dialog_text">Without accepting, we can\'t alert your circle if you need help. The app will close — you can reopen it anytime to decide again.</string>
    <string name="privacy_close_app_button">Close the app</string>
    <string name="privacy_keep_viewing_button">Keep viewing</string>

